# C++ toolchain for interface/ (the LAMMPS plugin + engine bridge).
# Google base at its native 80-column limit — the tree was written to it.
# SortIncludes is off because include order here is deliberate: LAMMPS
# headers group by protocol role (pair.h first, then the subsystem headers
# a callback touches), and torch/ATen headers stay below the molnex ones.
BasedOnStyle: Google
SortIncludes: Never
